# LAW DELETED STAYS GONE, from the law library (note/project/term/assurance/prove-loop/decision/002-law-library.md): no
# view of any state shows a deleted note. Every note the app's `view` computes for any person is live.
#
# A project states the law by FUSING this template with its own forms and its view task, and proves the claim it
# makes with a `task deleted-stays-gone` of its own. It may not write the claim itself: `term knit` refuses a claim
# named `deleted-stays-gone` that is not this one (call/code/knit-law.ts). The template is used IN the file that fuses
# it: `term knit` appends this text below a marker at that file's end, because `term hold --report` and the Lean exporter
# read only a file's own templates.
#
#   fuse deleted-stays-gone-law
#     bind state, shelf
#     bind natural, natural
#     bind rank, rank
#     bind person, person
#     bind view, view
#
# THE SHAPE IT READS, whatever the forms are called: `state` is a list with the cases `bare` and `more` (`top`, a
# note, and `rest`), a live note is the case `live` (`at`, `whose`, both a `natural`), `person` is a record of `id`
# and `rank`, and `view` takes the state and a person to a state.
#
# Its shape is law.tree's `deleted-stays-gone-of-view` in test/assurance/notes, the notes demo, with `all-live` from the
# same file. The body is written so it reads the same in a lean file and a longhand one.

tree deleted-stays-gone-law
  take state, like name
  take natural, like name
  take rank, like name
  take person, like name
  take view, like name

  hook fuse
    # every note on the list is live
    form all-live
      head v, like {state}
      case live-end
        head
          make bare
      case live-on
        link at, like {natural}
        link whose, like {natural}
        link rest, like {state}
        link rest-live
          like all-live
            head
              read rest
        head
          make more
            bind top
              make live
                bind at, at
                bind whose, whose
            bind rest, rest

    # DELETED STAYS GONE: every note `view` computes for any person is live
    rule deleted-stays-gone
      take s, like {state}
      take i, like {natural}
      take r, like {rank}
      like all-live
        head
          call {view}
            read s
            make {person}
              bind id, i
              bind rank, r
